# https://www.w3schools.com/python/

These exericises were created based on the W3schools Python tutorials. I have primarily used the above mentioned website to learn Python programming
and used the PyCharm application to code them. The order of presented coding folders are in the same order I followed the website to learn the given concepts. 
I have added extra comments and details for clarity and better understanding. Anyone who wanted to learn Python should follow along the folder structures given 
below.
